  "：Junos 为 PE 路由器内部的 iBGP 邻居开通了特权通道。为了保证同一个 AS 内的 VPN 业务能够以最简配置跑通，Junos 隐式地允许将这些由本地 VRF 产生、带有 RT 标签的 IGP/静态路由，自动泛洪给所有的 MP-iBGP 邻居。": ": Junos opens a privileged channel for iBGP neighbors within the PE router. To ensure that VPN services within the same AS can run with minimal configuration, Junos implicitly allows these IGP/static routes, which are generated by the local VRF and tagged with an RT, to be automatically flooded to all MP-iBGP neighbors.",
