  "：一旦涉及 eBGP（跨越 AS 边界），Junos 就会收回特权，严格执行上述的“BGP 默认导出法则”。因为这条路由的原始血统是 OSPF，并非 BGP 路由，所以在发送给 eBGP 邻居时被默认策略直接拦截。": ": Once eBGP is involved (crossing AS boundaries), Junos revokes the privilege and strictly enforces the aforementioned \"BGP Default Export Policy.\" Because the original lineage of this route is OSPF, not a BGP route, it is intercepted by the default policy when sent to an eBGP neighbor.",
