  "通告的网络地址（发布缺省路由时填": "Advertised network address (filled when advertising default route",
  "通告的目的地址的掩码（发布缺省路由时填": "Mask of the advertised destination address (filled when advertising default route",
  "外部度量值类型：": "External metric type:",
  ": 第一类外部路由 (Type-1)，总开销 = ASBR 开销 + 内部到达 ASBR 的 Cost。": ": Type-1 external route (Type-1), total cost = ASBR cost + internal cost to reach ASBR.",
  ": 第二类外部路由 (Type-2，默认)，总开销 = 仅 ASBR 开销。": ": Type-2 external route (Type-2, default), total cost = ASBR cost only.",
  "到所通告的目的地址的报文将被转发到这个地址。": "Packets to the advertised destination address will be forwarded to this address.",
  "添加到外部路由上的标记。OSPF 本身并不使用这个字段，它可以用来对外部路由进行管理（如打 Tag 控制路由策略/BGP 重分发）。": "A tag added to the external route. OSPF does not use this field itself; it can be used for managing external routes (e.g., tagging to control routing policies/BGP redistribution).",
  "ToS 附加距离信息。": "ToS additional distance information.",
  "5 类 LSA 中 FA 地址非 0.0.0.0 的三大条件（必须同时满足）": "Three major conditions for FA address to be non-0.0.0.0 in Type 5 LSAs (must all be met):",
  "引入外部路由的出接口使能了 OSPF 并宣告进域内；": "The outbound interface for importing external routes has OSPF enabled and is advertised into the area;",
