  "2. 数据转发路径对比 (Mermaid 动态流向图)": "2. Data Forwarding Path Comparison (Mermaid Dynamic Flow Diagram)",
  "情况 A：若没有 FA 机制 (FA = 0.0.0.0) —— 三角折返次优": "Case A: Without FA mechanism (FA = 0.0.0.0) — Triangular suboptimal routing",
