  "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '11px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 18\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart TD\n    R1[\"R1 (Area 0 核心源头)\"] -->|\"① 查表去往外部找 ASBR R3\"| R2[\"R2 (ABR 网关)\"]\n    R2 -->|\"② 打向 SW1 (目标 MAC: R3)\"| SW[\"SW1 接入交换机\"]\n    SW -->|\"③ 交付给 ASBR\"| R3[\"R3 (ASBR 业务网关)\"]\n    \n    subgraph WasteLoop [\"【 致命次优: 同一以太网口进包又出包 】\"]\n        R3 -->|\"④ 查静态路由折返抛出 (同一物理口)\"| SW\n    end\n    \n    SW -->|\"⑤ 转发给真实外网网关\"| RISP[\"R_ISP (10.1.1.254)\"]\n    RISP -->|\"⑥ 送达目的地\"| Dest[\"业务服务器 192.168.100.1\"]\n\n    style WasteLoop fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray: 4 4": "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '11px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 18\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart TD\n    R1[\"R1 (Area 0 Core Source)\"] -->|\"① Lookup route to external ASBR R3\"| R2[\"R2 (ABR Gateway)\"]\n    R2 -->|\"② Forward to SW1 (Target MAC: R3)\"| SW[\"SW1 Access Switch\"]\n    SW -->|\"③ Deliver to ASBR\"| R3[\"R3 (ASBR Service Gateway)\"]\n    \n    subgraph WasteLoop [\"【 Fatal Suboptimality: Packet enters and exits same Ethernet port 】\"]\n        R3 -->|\"④ Lookup static route and hairpin (same physical port)\"| SW\n    end\n    \n    SW -->|\"⑤ Forward to real external gateway\"| RISP[\"R_ISP (10.1.1.254)\"]\n    RISP -->|\"⑥ Reach destination\"| Dest[\"Service Server 192.168.100.1\"]\n\n    style WasteLoop fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray: 4 4",
  "情况 B：启用 FA 机制 (FA = 10.1.1.254) —— 破除次优，一跳直达": "Case B: Enable FA mechanism (FA = 10.1.1.254) — Eliminate suboptimality, one-hop direct access",
  "ASBR (R3) 发现外部下一跳与自己处于同一个广播域，主动置位": "ASBR (R3) detects that the external next-hop is in the same broadcast domain and proactively sets the",
  "。ABR 收到后直接将同网段的 FA 设为二层下一跳，": ". Upon receiving this, the ABR directly sets the FA in the same subnet as the Layer 2 next-hop,",
  "彻底旁路 ASBR": "completely bypassing the ASBR",
  "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '11px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 18\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart TD\n    R1[\"R1 (Area 0 核心源头)\"] -->|\"① 发现 FA=10.1.1.254 位于 Area 1\"| R2[\"R2 (ABR 网关)\"]\n    R2 -->|\"② 发现 FA 在本网段，直接 ARP 解析 R_ISP MAC\"| SW[\"SW1 接入交换机\"]\n    SW -->|\"③ 二层线速交换，一步到位\"| RISP[\"R_ISP (10.1.1.254)\"]\n    RISP -->|\"④ 送达目的地\"| Dest[\"业务服务器 192.168.100.1\"]\n\n    subgraph BypassNode [\"【 完美旁路: 0 流量损耗 】\"]\n        R3_Bypass[\"R3 (ASBR 网关)<br/>全程围观，0 转发开销\"]\n    end\n\n    style BypassNode fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px": "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '11px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 18\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart TD\n    R1[\"R1 (Area 0 Core Source)\"] -->|\"① Discover FA=10.1.1.254 is in Area 1\"| R2[\"R2 (ABR Gateway)\"]\n    R2 -->|\"② Discover FA is on local segment, ARP resolve R_ISP MAC directly\"| SW[\"SW1 Access Switch\"]\n    SW -->|\"③ L2 wire-speed switching, one-step delivery\"| RISP[\"R_ISP (10.1.1.254)\"]\n    RISP -->|\"④ Deliver to destination\"| Dest[\"Service Server 192.168.100.1\"]\n\n    subgraph BypassNode [\"【 Perfect Bypass: 0 Traffic Loss 】\"]\n        R3_Bypass[\"R3 (ASBR Gateway)<br/>Full observation, 0 forwarding overhead\"]\n    end\n\n    style BypassNode fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px",
