  "7 类 LSA (NSSA-External) 中的 FA": "FA in Type 7 LSA (NSSA-External)",
  "对待 0.0.0.0 的态度": "Attitude toward 0.0.0.0",
  "常态（绝大多数都是 0.0.0.0）": "Normal state (the vast majority are 0.0.0.0)",
