  "正常业务发布，向全网宣告外部网络。": "Normal service advertisement, announcing external networks to the entire network.",
  "7 类缺省路由": "Type 7 Default Route",
  "(缺省)": "(Default)",
  "否 (严禁翻译)": "No (Strictly prohibited from translation)",
  "破除死锁环路": "Break deadlock loops",
  "！防止双 ABR 架构下缺省路由倒灌回骨干网。": "! Prevent default routes from leaking back into the backbone in a dual-ABR architecture.",
