  "管理组 / 亲和属性（Administrative Group / Color）": "Administrative Group / Color",
  "。32 位位掩码，用于链路染色。": ". 32-bit bitmask used for link coloring.",
  "2. GMPLS 与光网络扩展子 TLV (RFC 4203)": "2. GMPLS and Optical Network Extension Sub-TLVs (RFC 4203)",
  "核心业务含义": "Core business meaning",
  "用于": "Used for",
  "Unnumbered (无 IP 地址) 链路": "Unnumbered links",
  "。包含本地 4 字节 IfIndex 和远端 4 字节 IfIndex。": ". Contains a local 4-byte IfIndex and a remote 4-byte IfIndex.",
  "描述链路物理保护等级（Extra Traffic, Unprotected, Shared, Dedicated 1:1, Enhanced 等）。": "Describes the physical link protection level (Extra Traffic, Unprotected, Shared, Dedicated 1:1, Enhanced, etc.).",
  "变长": "Variable length",
  "描述接口交换能力（PSC、L2SC、TDM、LSC 光波长交换能力）。": "Describes interface switching capability (PSC, L2SC, TDM, LSC optical wavelength switching capability).",
  "共享风险链路组": "Shared Risk Link Group",
  "。携带一个或多个 32 位整数，标识共用同一物理管井的风险集合，CSPF 据此计算物理真冗余双路径。": ". Carries one or more 32-bit integers identifying risk sets sharing the same physical conduit, used by CSPF to calculate physically redundant dual paths.",
  "3. 网络性能与单向时延测量扩展子 TLV (RFC 7471)": "3. Network Performance and Unidirectional Delay Measurement Extension Sub-TLVs (RFC 7471)",
  "在 5G 电信承载网、金融高频交易与低延时算力网络中，": "In 5G telecom bearer networks, financial high-frequency trading, and low-latency computing networks,",
