  "4. 段路由 Segment Routing 核心扩展子 TLV (RFC 8665)": "4. Segment Routing Core Extension Sub-TLVs (RFC 8665)",
  "在现代统一控制平面体系（SR-MPLS / SRv6）中，OSPF 直接在 Link TLV 内部挂载分段标签：": "In modern unified control plane architectures (SR-MPLS / SRv6), OSPF mounts segment labels directly inside the Link TLV:",
  "邻接段标签（核心关键！）": "Adjacency Segment Identifier (Adj-SID) (Core critical!)",
  "。为该直连物理链路分配的局部段路由标签（SID/Label），控制器计算出显式路径后，直接将一串 Adj-SID 压入报文头进行源路由转发。": ". The local Segment Routing label (SID/Label) assigned to this directly connected physical link. After the controller calculates an explicit path, it pushes a sequence of Adj-SIDs into the packet header for source routing forwarding.",
  "flowchart LR\n    R1[\"【起点 R1 (PE-1)】<br/>LSR-ID: 1.1.1.1<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.1\"] ===|\"GE1/0/1 (Cost=10, 100M)\"| R2[\"【中继 R2 (P)】<br/>LSR-ID: 2.2.2.2<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.2\"]\n    R2 ===|\"GE1/0/2 (Cost=10, 100M)\"| R3[\"【终点 R3 (PE-2)】<br/>LSR-ID: 3.3.3.3<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.3\"]\n\n    Tunnel[\"要求建立 MPLS TE Tunnel<br/>从 R1 直达 R3: destination 3.3.3.3, 带宽 50M\"]\n    \n    style R1 fill:#ddf4ff,stroke:#0969da,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style R2 fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#d0d7de,stroke-width:1px\n    style R3 fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style Tunnel fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px": "flowchart LR\n    R1[\"[Start R1 (PE-1)]<br/>LSR-ID: 1.1.1.1<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.1\"] ===|\"GE1/0/1 (Cost=10, 100M)\"| R2[\"[Relay R2 (P)]<br/>LSR-ID: 2.2.2.2<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.2\"]\n    R2 ===|\"GE1/0/2 (Cost=10, 100M)\"| R3[\"[End R3 (PE-2)]<br/>LSR-ID: 3.3.3.3<br/>OSPF RID: 10.0.0.3\"]\n\n    Tunnel[\"Requirement: Establish MPLS TE Tunnel<br/>from R1 to R3: destination 3.3.3.3, bandwidth 50M\"]\n    \n    style R1 fill:#ddf4ff,stroke:#0969da,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style R2 fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#d0d7de,stroke-width:1px\n    style R3 fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style Tunnel fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px",
