  "即可。": ".",
  "：1 类、2 类、": ": Type 1, Type 2,",
  "三、 NSSA 系列区域 (非完全末梢区域)": "III. NSSA Series Areas (Not-So-Stubby Area)",
  "核心考点：Type-7 缺省路由的产生条件": "Core Exam Topic: Conditions for generating Type-7 default routes",
  "在 NSSA 区域中，Type-7 缺省 LSA 的产生严格区分设备角色（ABR vs ASBR），且自带防黑洞检测机制。": "In an NSSA area, the generation of Type-7 default LSAs strictly distinguishes between device roles (ABR vs. ASBR) and includes a built-in black hole detection mechanism.",
  "1. 普通 NSSA 区域": "1. Normal NSSA Area",
  "：在普通 Stub 区域基础上，允许本区域内存在 ASBR。ASBR 会将引入的外部路由转为 7 类 LSA 在本区域泛洪，随后 ABR 会将 7 类转换为 5 类在其他区域泛洪。": ": Based on a normal Stub area, it allows the existence of an ASBR within the area. The ASBR converts imported external routes into Type 7 LSAs to be flooded within the area, and subsequently, the ABR converts Type 7 LSAs into Type 5 LSAs to be flooded into other areas.",
  "Type-7 缺省下发条件 (严格区分)": "Type-7 default generation conditions (strictly distinguished)",
