  "2. 标准计算步骤": "2. Standard calculation steps",
  "将待校验报文视为连续的 16 位（2 字节）大端整数序列。若总长度为奇数字节，末尾补一个字节": "Treat the packet to be verified as a sequence of consecutive 16-bit (2-byte) big-endian integers. If the total length is an odd number of bytes, pad with one byte at the end.",
  "将所有 16 位整数累加到一个 32 位累加器中。": "Accumulate all 16-bit integers into a 32-bit accumulator.",
  "将高 16 位（进位）移至低 16 位反复相加，直到高 16 位为 0（折叠为 16 位）。": "Repeatedly add the high 16 bits (carry) to the low 16 bits until the high 16 bits are 0 (folded to 16 bits).",
