  "学习 OSPF 的 LSA，死记字段和类型编号往往事倍功半。": "When learning OSPF LSAs, rote memorization of fields and type numbers is often half the effort for twice the result.",
  "协议设计不是凭空捏造的，而是面对具体的工程痛点妥协与权衡的产物。": "Protocol design is not fabricated out of thin air, but is the product of compromises and trade-offs in the face of specific engineering pain points.",
  "本篇通过一个贯穿全局的复杂生产网络拓扑演化，针对每一类 LSA 提出核心的“架构质问（为什么必须这样）”，深入剖析 IETF 架构师在面对性能爆炸、故障风暴、递归断层与边界矛盾时的设计哲学。": "This article uses a complex production network topology evolution that runs through the entire subject to pose core 'architectural questions (why must it be this way?)' for each type of LSA, deeply analyzing the design philosophy of IETF architects when facing performance explosions, failure storms, recursive faults, and boundary contradictions.",
