  "保持 ASBR 身份不变，使得全网无论隔了多少个区域，都能直接追溯该路由的真实源头，同时配合 4 类 LSA 即可完成轻量化拓扑定位。": "Keeping the ASBR identity unchanged allows the entire network to directly trace the true source of the route regardless of how many areas are in between, while simultaneously completing lightweight topology positioning in conjunction with Type 4 LSAs.",
