  "三、 核心认知与设计哲学总结": "III. Summary of Core Cognition and Design Philosophy",
  "+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                               OSPF 链路状态核心哲学                               |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| 1. 拓扑优化  | 伪节点 (Pseudonode) 机制将 O(N^2) 复杂度降为 O(N) 星型连接。       |\n| 2. 状态推举  | 先定 BDR 再晋升 DR，自下而上杜绝无序争抢与网络双主分裂。          |\n| 3. 安全隔离  | 224.0.0.6 与 224.0.0.5 组播分权，在硬件网卡层保护普通节点 CPU。   |\n| 4. 架构解耦  | 网络类型是可控的逻辑抽象；直连以太网改 P2P 是消除复杂度的利器。   |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+": "+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                               OSPF Link-State Core Philosophy                               |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| 1. Topology Optimization  | Pseudonode mechanism reduces O(N^2) complexity to O(N) star connections.       |\n| 2. State Election  | Elect BDR first then promote to DR, preventing disorderly contention and split-brain from the bottom up.          |\n| 3. Security Isolation  | Multicast separation of 224.0.0.6 and 224.0.0.5 protects ordinary node CPUs at the hardware NIC layer.   |\n| 4. Architectural Decoupling  | Network type is a controllable logical abstraction; changing direct Ethernet to P2P is a powerful tool to eliminate complexity.   |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
