  "但 RFC 规定了一旦收到邻居 Hello 且发现其中已声明了有效 DR/BDR 时，立即触发": "However, the RFC stipulates that once a neighbor's Hello is received and it is discovered that a valid DR/BDR has already been declared, it immediately triggers",
  "BackupSeen 事件": "the BackupSeen event",
  "40 秒倒计时瞬间掐断": "The 40-second countdown is instantly cut off",
  "，新上线设备以毫秒级速度直接融入现有拓扑，兼顾了冷启动的防冲突与热插拔的高收敛。": ", allowing newly connected devices to integrate directly into the existing topology at millisecond speeds, balancing anti-collision for cold starts with high convergence for hot-swapping.",
