  "3. 按需链路与静默刷新抑制 (DC-bit / RFC 1793)": "3. Demand Circuits and Silent Refresh Suppression (DC-bit / RFC 1793)",
  "DoNotAge (DNA) 机制": "DoNotAge (DNA) mechanism",
  "：\n在通过按需链路（Demand Circuits，如拨号/计费链路）互联时，为了避免每隔 30 分钟周期性泛洪 LSA 刷新 LSDB，RFC 1793 定义了": ":\nWhen interconnecting via Demand Circuits (e.g., dial-up/metered links), to avoid periodic LSA flooding every 30 minutes to refresh the LSDB, RFC 1793 defines",
  "当通过按需链路同步数据库时，LSA 头部 Options 中的": "When synchronizing the database over demand circuits, the",
  "置 1，配合将": "in the LSA header Options is set to 1, in conjunction with setting",
  "的最高位置 1（成为 DoNotAge 属性）。": "the highest bit to 1 (becoming the DoNotAge attribute).",
  "泛洪沿途的所有路由器通过读取 LSA 头部的": "All routers along the flooding path, by reading the",
  "，便知道": "in the LSA header, know that",
  "这条 LSA 不需要参与 1800 秒的周期性刷新和老化计时": "this LSA does not need to participate in the 1800-second periodic refresh and aging timer",
  "，避免了链路被频繁无意义激活。": ", avoiding frequent and meaningless activation of the link.",
  "4. 组播 OSPF 组播路由树计算 (MC-bit / RFC 1584)": "4. Multicast OSPF Multicast Routing Tree Calculation (MC-bit / RFC 1584)",
  "MOSPF 转发路径判定": "MOSPF forwarding path determination",
  "：\n在组播 OSPF 扩展中，单播 SPF 树与组播数据转发树是分立的。路由器必须读取 LSA 头部的": ":\nIn multicast OSPF extensions, the unicast SPF tree and the multicast data forwarding tree are separate. Routers must read the",
  "，判断宣告该 LSA 的节点是否具备组播数据报文硬件线速转发能力，以决定是否将该节点纳入组播 SPF 计算。": "in the LSA header to determine whether the node advertising the LSA has the hardware line-rate forwarding capability for multicast packets, in order to decide whether to include that node in the multicast SPF calculation.",
  "5. Opaque LSA 的泛洪范围与能力声明 (RFC 5250)": "5. Opaque LSA Flooding Scope and Capability Declaration (RFC 5250)",
  "TE 与 Segment Routing 扩展": "TE and Segment Routing extensions",
  "：\n在 MPLS-TE、BGP-LS 以及 SR-MPLS 环境下泛洪的 Type-9/10/11 Opaque LSA，沿途节点依靠 LSA 头部 Options 中的": ":\nFor Type-9/10/11 Opaque LSAs flooded in MPLS-TE, BGP-LS, and SR-MPLS environments, nodes along the path rely on the",
  "快速识别该 LSA 是否承载了流量工程或标签拓扑扩展属性。": "in the LSA header Options to quickly identify whether the LSA carries traffic engineering or label topology extension attributes.",
  "二、 链路级 Options vs LSA 级 Options 对比": "II. Comparison of Link-level Options vs. LSA-level Options",
