  "生效层级": "Effective level",
  "直接把这 5 个字全部进行一的补码累加": "Perform a one's complement summation of all these 5 words directly.",
  "前四个非 Checksum 字相加（同步骤 1）:\n  0x4500 + 0x003C + 0xF820 + 0x4000 = 0x17D5C\n\n将累加结果与收到的 Checksum (0x82A2) 相加:\n    0x17D5C\n  +  0x82A2\n  ---------\n    0x1FFFF  <--- 产生了溢出进位 '1'\n\n端点进位回卷折叠（高 16 位加到低 16 位）:\n    低 16 位: 0xFFFF\n  + 高 16 位: 0x0001\n  ------------------\n    0x10000  <--- 再次产生进位 '1'\n\n继续将进位回卷加到低位:\n    低 16 位: 0x0000\n  + 高 16 位: 0x0001\n  ------------------\n    0xFFFF": "Sum the first four non-Checksum words (same as step 1):\n  0x4500 + 0x003C + 0xF820 + 0x4000 = 0x17D5C\n\nAdd the summation result to the received Checksum (0x82A2):\n    0x17D5C\n  +  0x82A2\n  ---------\n    0x1FFFF  <--- Overflow carry '1' generated\n\nEndpoint carry wrap-around folding (add high 16 bits to low 16 bits):\n    Low 16 bits: 0xFFFF\n  + High 16 bits: 0x0001\n  ------------------\n    0x10000  <--- Carry '1' generated again\n\nContinue to wrap the carry back to the low bits:\n    Low 16 bits: 0x0000\n  + High 16 bits: 0x0001\n  ------------------\n    0xFFFF",
  "校验裁决：": "Checksum Verdict:",
  "最终累加结果为": "The final summation result is",
  "（全 1）。\n按位取反后：": "(all 1s).\nAfter bitwise inversion:",
