  "混为一谈，误以为只要配了 LSA 节流就不需要震荡抑制。这是极具欺骗性的认知盲区。": "mistakenly believing that as long as LSA throttling is configured, flapping suppression is unnecessary. This is a highly deceptive cognitive blind spot.",
  "flowchart TD\n    subgraph Event [\"【 物理链路以 2 秒一次的频率持续闪断 】\"]\n        LinkFlap[\"网线虚接 / 光模块衰耗超标 / 弱光抖动\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph BranchA [\"【 仅有：LSA 泛洪抑制 (lsa-originate/arrival) 】\"]\n        direction TB\n        ActA1[\"控制面节流：拉长生成/接收间隔至 5000ms\"]\n        ActA2[\"阻断了高频的 LSU 泛洪风暴，保护了全网带宽与 CPU\"]\n        FaultA[\"【致命漏洞】5秒一到，LSA 依然产生并泛洪！<br/>由于主链路 Cost=10，SPF 依旧选为主路！<br/>★ 业务流量每 5 秒在主备链路上'跳水横跳一次'，TCP 全部乱序丢包！\"]\n        ActA1 --> ActA2 --> FaultA\n    end\n\n    subgraph BranchB [\"【 部署：邻居震荡抑制 (suppress-flapping peer) 】\"]\n        direction TB\n        ActB1[\"识别病态链路：累计闪断达到 threshold (缺省10次)\"]\n        ActB2[\"【Hold-max-cost】宣告 Metric=65535，彻底剥夺主路优选权\"]\n        ActB3[\"【Hold-down】直接拉黑邻居，停止 Hello/DD 协商，物理层不握手\"]\n        ResultB[\"【彻底止血】无论链路怎么闪断，业务流量死死锚定在健康备链上！<br/>★ 0 丢包，0 横跳，业务平稳运行！\"]\n        ActB1 --> ActB2 --> ResultB\n        ActB1 --> ActB3 --> ResultB\n    end\n\n    LinkFlap --> BranchA\n    LinkFlap --> BranchB\n\n    style BranchA fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style BranchB fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px": "flowchart TD\n    subgraph Event [\"【 Physical link flaps continuously at a frequency of 2 seconds 】\"]\n        LinkFlap[\"Loose cable / Optical module attenuation exceeds limit / Weak light jitter\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph BranchA [\"【 Only: LSA flooding suppression (lsa-originate/arrival) 】\"]\n        direction TB\n        ActA1[\"Control plane throttling: Extend generation/reception interval to 5000ms\"]\n        ActA2[\"Blocks high-frequency LSU flooding storms, protecting network bandwidth and CPU\"]\n        FaultA[\"【Fatal Flaw】Once 5 seconds pass, LSA is still generated and flooded!<br/>Since main link Cost=10, SPF still selects it as the main path!<br/>★ Service traffic 'flips' between main and backup links every 5 seconds, causing TCP out-of-order packet loss!\"]\n        ActA1 --> ActA2 --> FaultA\n    end\n\n    subgraph BranchB [\"【 Deployed: Neighbor flapping suppression (suppress-flapping peer) 】\"]\n        direction TB\n        ActB1[\"Identify unhealthy link: Cumulative flaps reach threshold (default 10 times)\"]\n        ActB2[\"【Hold-max-cost】Advertise Metric=65535, completely stripping main path preference\"]\n        ActB3[\"【Hold-down】Blacklist neighbor, stop Hello/DD negotiation, no physical layer handshake\"]\n        ResultB[\"【Complete Hemostasis】No matter how the link flaps, service traffic is firmly anchored to the healthy backup link!<br/>★ 0 packet loss, 0 flipping, services run stably!\"]\n        ActB1 --> ActB2 --> ResultB\n        ActB1 --> ActB3 --> ResultB\n    end\n\n    LinkFlap --> BranchA\n    LinkFlap --> BranchB\n\n    style BranchA fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style BranchB fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px",
