  "系统进入抑制状态后，支持单一模式或双模式叠加保护：": "After the system enters the suppression state, it supports single-mode or dual-mode overlay protection:",
  "flowchart TD\n    Trigger[\"震荡次数达到 threshold\"] --> ModeCheck{\"当前启用的抑制模式？\"}\n\n    ModeCheck -- \"Hold-down\" --> HD[\"【 Hold-down 阶段 】<br/>• 阻断 Hello 握手协商<br/>• 严禁进入 2-Way/ExStart<br/>• 隔绝协议报文泛洪与抗攻击\"]\n    ModeCheck -- \"Hold-max-cost (系统缺省)\" --> HMC[\"【 Hold-max-cost 阶段 】<br/>• 允许邻居正常协商至 Full<br/>• 宣告 Type-1 LSA Metric=65535<br/>• 业务流量绕行备用链路\"]\n    \n    ModeCheck -- \"两者叠加使能\" --> Both[\"【 叠加混合模式 】<br/>先进入 Hold-down 隔绝报文交互<br/>   ↓ (Hold-down 定时器超时退出)<br/>再进入 Hold-max-cost 隔离业务流量\"]\n\n    style HD fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style HMC fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px\n    style Both fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px": "flowchart TD\n    Trigger[\"Flapping count reaches threshold\"] --> ModeCheck{\"Currently enabled suppression mode?\"}\n\n    ModeCheck -- \"Hold-down\" --> HD[\"【 Hold-down Phase 】<br/>• Block Hello handshake negotiation<br/>• Strictly prohibit entering 2-Way/ExStart<br/>• Isolate protocol packet flooding and anti-attack\"]\n    ModeCheck -- \"Hold-max-cost (System Default)\" --> HMC[\"【 Hold-max-cost Phase 】<br/>• Allow neighbor to negotiate normally to Full<br/>• Advertise Type-1 LSA Metric=65535<br/>• Bypass service traffic to backup link\"]\n    \n    ModeCheck -- \"Both enabled\" --> Both[\"【 Overlay Hybrid Mode 】<br/>Enter Hold-down first to isolate packet interaction<br/>   ↓ (Hold-down timer expires)\nThen enter Hold-max-cost to isolate service traffic\"]\n\n    style HD fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style HMC fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px\n    style Both fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px",
