  "5. Type 5: Link State Acknowledgment (LSAck) 报文 (RFC 2328 Section A.3.6)": "5. Type 5: Link State Acknowledgment (LSAck) packet (RFC 2328 Section A.3.6)",
  "用于向邻居对已收到的 LSU 报文提供显式确认（Explicit Acknowledgment），保障 LSA 泛洪与同步的可靠性。": "Used to provide explicit acknowledgment to neighbors for received LSU packets, ensuring the reliability of LSA flooding and synchronization.",
  "LSAck 报文": "LSAck packet",
  "不需要回传任何 LSA 明细内容": "No need to return any LSA detail content",
  "，只需原样拷回接收到的每条 LSA 的": ", simply copy back the",
  "20 字节标准头部": "20-byte standard header",
  "。对方通过比对头部的序列号与校验和即可确认送达。": "of each received LSA. The peer confirms delivery by comparing the sequence number and checksum of the header.",
  "LSAck 确认方式对照": "LSAck confirmation method comparison",
  "显式确认 (Explicit ACK)": "Explicit ACK",
  "：接收方收到 LSU 后，单独打包构造 Type 5 LSAck 报文回复。": ": After the receiver receives an LSU, it constructs and replies with a separate Type 5 LSAck packet.",
  "隐式确认 (Implicit ACK)": "Implicit ACK",
  "两台路由器如果近乎同时向对方泛洪相同的 LSU 报文，直接以对方发来的 LSU 充当自己的确认，不再额外回复 LSAck。": "If two routers flood the same LSU packet to each other almost simultaneously, they use the LSU received from the peer as their own confirmation and do not send an additional LSAck.",
  "DD 报文交互期间，Slave 复制 Master 的 Sequence Number 发回报文充当对前序 DD 的确认。": "During DD packet exchange, the Slave copies the Master's Sequence Number and returns it in a packet to serve as confirmation for the previous DD.",
  "四、 必备：标准 20 字节 LSA 通用头部 (RFC 2328 Section 12.1.1)": "IV. Essential: Standard 20-byte LSA common header (RFC 2328 Section 12.1.1)",
  "为什么需要关注 LSA Header？": "Why do we need to pay attention to the LSA Header?",
  "DD 报文的载荷、LSAck 报文的载荷，本质上": "The payload of DD packets and the payload of LSAck packets are essentially",
  "完全由这 20 字节的 LSA Header 串联而成": "composed entirely of this 20-byte LSA Header",
  "：LSA 产生后的存活时间（秒）。生成时为 0，每经过一跳增加，最大存活时间": ": The time (in seconds) the LSA has been alive since generation. It is 0 when generated and increases with each hop, up to the maximum age",
  "。若需要老化撤销某条 LSA，将其 Age 置为 3600 后全网泛洪。": ". If an LSA needs to be aged out and revoked, set its Age to 3600 and flood it throughout the network.",
  "：同报文头 Options。": ": Same as packet header Options.",
