  "二、 阶段一：建立邻居状态流转 (Neighbor Phase)": "II. Phase 1: Neighbor State Transition (Neighbor Phase)",
  "该阶段核心目标是通过 Hello 报文确认链路的**双向通信对称性（Bidirectional Communication）**并完成接口参数协商。": "The core objective of this phase is to confirm the **Bidirectional Communication** of the link via Hello packets and complete interface parameter negotiation.",
  "本篇严格结合 IETF RFC 2328 标准，对 OSPF 网络类型特征、报文在各网络中的收发目的地址（含 RFC 纠错机制）以及 DR/BDR 选举算法进行全量汇编与校准。": "This article strictly adheres to the IETF RFC 2328 standard, providing a comprehensive compilation and calibration of OSPF network type characteristics, packet transmission/reception destination addresses across various networks (including RFC error correction mechanisms), and the DR/BDR election algorithm.",
