  "stateDiagram-v2\n    direction TB\n    \n    [*] --> Down : 接口使能 OSPF\n    Down --> Attempt : Event: Start (仅限 NBMA 静态配置 Peer)\n    Down --> Init : Event: HelloReceived (报文邻居列表无自身 RID)\n    Attempt --> Init : Event: HelloReceived (报文邻居列表无自身 RID)\n    \n    Init --> 2Way : Event: 2-WayReceived (报文邻居列表包含自身 RID)\n    \n    state \"2-Way 邻接评估 (RFC 2328 10.3)\" as Evaluation {\n        state \"是否需要建立邻接 (AdjOK?)？\" as Check <<choice>>\n    }\n    \n    2Way --> Check : 触发 AdjOK? 检查\n    Check --> 2Way : 否 (广播网中 DROther 与 DROther，永久保持 2-Way)\n    Check --> ExStart : 是 (P2P/P2MP 或 本端/对端为 DR/BDR)\n    \n    2Way --> Init : Event: 1-WayReceived (对端发来的 Hello 丢失自身 RID)": "stateDiagram-v2\n    direction TB\n    \n    [*] --> Down : Interface OSPF enabled\n    Down --> Attempt : Event: Start (NBMA static peer configuration only)\n    Down --> Init : Event: HelloReceived (Neighbor list in packet does not contain local RID)\n    Attempt --> Init : Event: HelloReceived (Neighbor list in packet does not contain local RID)\n    \n    Init --> 2Way : Event: 2-WayReceived (Neighbor list in packet contains local RID)\n    \n    state \"2-Way Adjacency Evaluation (RFC 2328 10.3)\" as Evaluation {\n        state \"Is adjacency establishment required (AdjOK?)?\" as Check <<choice>>\n    }\n    \n    2Way --> Check : Trigger AdjOK? check\n    Check --> 2Way : No (DROther to DROther on broadcast networks, remains 2-Way permanently)\n    Check --> ExStart : Yes (P2P/P2MP or local/remote is DR/BDR)\n    \n    2Way --> Init : Event: 1-WayReceived (Hello from peer missing local RID)",
  "1. 状态与 RFC 事件定义": "1. States and RFC Event Definitions",
