  "：仅在 NBMA（如 Frame Relay、ATM 或华为 P2MP-NBMA）网络中生效。本地在向手工配置的对端单播 Hello 后，等待对端响应。": ": Only effective in NBMA (e.g., Frame Relay, ATM, or Huawei P2MP-NBMA) networks. The local device waits for a response after unicasting a Hello to a manually configured peer.",
  "：本地收到邻居的 Hello 报文，但该报文的": ": The local device has received a Hello packet from the neighbor, but the",
