  "根据 RFC 2328 规定，所有邻接关系的建立必须先到达 2-Way，绝不存在跳过 2-Way 直接从 Init 到 ExStart 的路径": "According to RFC 2328, all adjacency establishments must reach 2-Way first; there is no path to skip 2-Way and go directly from Init to ExStart.",
