  "（在 P2P 链路上此跃迁在微秒级完成，因此命令行日志看起来像瞬间切换）。": "(On P2P links, this transition occurs in microseconds, so command-line logs may appear as an instantaneous switch).",
  "或更高状态下，若收到对端发来的 Hello 报文但其邻居列表突然移除了本地 Router-ID，立即跌退回": "or higher states, if a Hello packet is received from the peer but its neighbor list suddenly removes the local Router-ID, it immediately falls back to",
  "三、 阶段二：建立邻接状态流转 (Adjacency Phase)": "III. Phase 2: Adjacency State Transition (Adjacency Phase)",
  "该阶段在确定需要同步数据库的节点之间展开，通过 DD、LSR、LSU、LSAck 报文实现链路状态数据库的严格一致。": "This phase occurs between nodes that need to synchronize databases, achieving strict consistency of the Link State Database through DD, LSR, LSU, and LSAck packets.",
