  "该物理接口下游的所有设备": "All devices downstream of this physical interface",
  "5 类 LSA 泛洪遍历全 OSPF 自治系统（特殊区域除外）。对其过滤覆盖了“源头抑制”、“出接口物理剔除”以及“普通节点本地算路屏蔽”。": "Type 5 LSAs flood throughout the entire OSPF autonomous system (except for special areas). Filtering them covers \"source suppression,\" \"physical outbound interface removal,\" and \"local route calculation blocking on ordinary nodes.\"",
  "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '10px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 16\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph S_Ext [\"外部路由引入\"]\n        ExtR[\"静态/BGP<br/>172.16.1.0/24\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_ASBR [\"ASBR (R1) 5类源头控制\"]\n        direction TB\n        B1[\"① filter-policy export<br/>(OSPF 进程: 阻止生成5类)\"]\n        B2[\"② asbr-summary not-adv<br/>(OSPF 进程: 汇总并抑制生成)\"]\n        B1 --> B2\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_ABR_Out [\"ABR-1 (R2) 物理出接口\"]\n        B8[\"⑧ ospf filter-lsa-out ase<br/>(G0/0/2 出接口硬件阻断)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_Node_R3 [\"普通路由器 R3 (Area 0)\"]\n        direction TB\n        LSDB_R3[\"LSDB 接收并完整保存 5 类<br/>★【仍向 R4 正常泛洪】\"]\n        B7[\"⑦ filter-policy import<br/>(阻止进入本地 IP 路由表)\"]\n        RIB_R3[\"本地 IP 路由表 (RIB)\"]\n        LSDB_R3 --> B7\n        B7 -.->|\"被拦截\"| RIB_R3\n    end\n\n    ExtR --> B1\n    B2 -->|\"泛洪 5类\"| B8\n    B8 -->|\"出方向剔除\"| LSDB_R3\n\n    style B1 fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style B2 fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px\n    style B8 fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style B7 fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style LSDB_R3 fill:#ddf4ff,stroke:#0969da,stroke-width:1px": "%%{init: {\n  'theme': 'base',\n  'themeVariables': {\n    'fontSize': '10px',\n    'nodeSpacing': 12,\n    'rankSpacing': 16\n  }\n}}%%\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph S_Ext [\"External Route Import\"]\n        ExtR[\"Static/BGP<br/>172.16.1.0/24\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_ASBR [\"ASBR (R1) Type 5 Source Control\"]\n        direction TB\n        B1[\"① filter-policy export<br/>(OSPF Process: Prevent Type 5 generation)\"]\n        B2[\"② asbr-summary not-adv<br/>(OSPF Process: Aggregate and suppress generation)\"]\n        B1 --> B2\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_ABR_Out [\"ABR-1 (R2) Physical Outbound Interface\"]\n        B8[\"⑧ ospf filter-lsa-out ase<br/>(G0/0/2 Outbound interface hardware block)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph S_Node_R3 [\"Ordinary Router R3 (Area 0)\"]\n        direction TB\n        LSDB_R3[\"LSDB receives and stores Type 5 fully<br/>★【Still floods normally to R4】\"]\n        B7[\"⑦ filter-policy import<br/>(Prevent entry into local IP routing table)\"]\n        RIB_R3[\"Local IP Routing Table (RIB)\"]\n        LSDB_R3 --> B7\n        B7 -.->|\"Intercepted\"| RIB_R3\n    end\n\n    ExtR --> B1\n    B2 -->|\"Flood Type 5\"| B8\n    B8 -->|\"Outbound removal\"| LSDB_R3\n\n    style B1 fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style B2 fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:1px\n    style B8 fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1px\n    style B7 fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:1.5px\n    style LSDB_R3 fill:#ddf4ff,stroke:#0969da,stroke-width:1px",
  "1. 阻断点 ①：": "1. Blocking Point ①:",
