  "：在执行": ": When executing",
  "时，直接按策略规则匹配。未通过 permit 的外部路由根本无法进入 OSPF，": ", it matches directly according to policy rules. External routes that do not pass the permit cannot enter OSPF at all,",
  "R1 压根不会为它生成 5 类 LSA": "R1 will not generate a Type 5 LSA for it at all.",
