  "2. 阻断点 ②：": "2. Blocking Point ②:",
  "（外部聚合源头抑制）": "(External aggregation source suppression)",
  "：ASBR 引入多条明细外部路由后，执行聚合操作并带上": ": After the ASBR imports multiple specific external routes, it performs aggregation and includes",
  "ASBR 既不产生明细 5 类 LSA，也不产生汇总 5 类 LSA": "The ASBR neither generates specific Type 5 LSAs nor summary Type 5 LSAs.",
  "3. 阻断点 ⑧：": "3. Blocking Point ⑧:",
  "（物理接口 5 类硬件过滤）": "(Physical interface Type 5 hardware filtering)",
  "任意设备出接口": "Any device's outbound interface",
  "（例如 ABR-1 R2 的": "(e.g., ABR-1 R2's",
  "：设备本地正常持有该 5 类 LSA，但在向该物理端口发送包含 5 类的 LSU 报文时，硬件报文引擎按 ACL 强行将该 5 类 LSA 剔除丢弃。": ": The device normally holds the Type 5 LSA locally, but when sending an LSU packet containing the Type 5 LSA to this physical port, the hardware packet engine forcibly removes and discards the Type 5 LSA according to the ACL.",
  "影响该出接口下游所有设备的 LSDB": "Affects the LSDB of all downstream devices on this outbound interface.",
  "。对端 R3 及其后续的 R4、R5 将无法通过该链路学到该 5 类 LSA。": ". The peer R3 and its subsequent R4 and R5 will not be able to learn this Type 5 LSA through this link.",
  "4. 阻断点 ⑦：": "4. Blocking Point ⑦:",
  "（普通节点算路平面拦截 —— 最易混淆）": "(Ordinary node calculation plane interception — most confusing)",
  "骨干网普通路由器 R3": "Backbone ordinary router R3",
  "绝对不影响 LSDB！": "Does not affect the LSDB at all!",
  "R3 依然正常接收并把该 5 类 LSA 存入自身 LSDB；": "R3 still receives and stores the Type 5 LSA in its own LSDB normally;",
  "绝对不阻断向后泛洪！": "Does not block downstream flooding at all!",
  "R3 依然忠实地把该 5 类 LSA 发给下游邻居 R4，": "R3 still faithfully sends this Type 5 LSA to downstream neighbor R4,",
  "R4 和 R5 依然能正常计算出该路由！": "R4 and R5 can still calculate this route normally!",
  "仅在 R3 本地 SPF 算路结束、准备将": "Only at the moment when R3 finishes local SPF calculation and is about to write",
