  "仅影响 R3 自身的本地 IP 路由表": "Only affects R3's own local IP routing table.",
  "四、 前缀列表 (IP-Prefix) 匹配法则深度纠错": "IV. In-depth Error Correction for IP-Prefix Matching Rules",
  "很多路由过滤在生产中不生效，核心在于把前缀列表（IP-Prefix）的“前缀长度”与“掩码范围”混为一谈：": "Many route filters do not take effect in production; the core issue is confusing the \"prefix length\" of an IP-Prefix with the \"mask range\":",
