  "先分清类型和生成者，再判断传播范围。": "First distinguish the type and generator, then determine the propagation scope.",
  "1/2 类不是原封不动穿越 ABR；5 类可穿越普通区域；7 类限于 NSSA。": "Type 1/2 do not pass through ABRs unchanged; Type 5 can pass through normal areas; Type 7 is limited to NSSA.",
