  "同一条外部路由，FA 改变的是下一跳解析目标。把控制面和业务路径分开看。": "For the same external route, FA changes the next-hop resolution target. View the control plane and traffic path separately.",
  "FA 非零且可达": "FA is non-zero and reachable",
  "FA 非零但不可达": "FA is non-zero but unreachable",
  "ASBR 发布外部前缀及 FA。Advertising Router 说明谁通告；FA 说明如何解析转发目标。": "ASBR advertises external prefixes and FA. Advertising Router indicates who advertises; FA indicates how to resolve the forwarding target.",
  "谁发布路由，不一定就是业务下一跳。": "Who advertises the route is not necessarily the traffic next-hop.",
