  "业务沿到 ASBR 的路径转发，再进入外部网络。": "Traffic is forwarded along the path to the ASBR before entering the external network.",
  "FA=0 表示通过通告该 LSA 的 ASBR 解析。": "FA=0 means resolution is performed via the ASBR that advertised this LSA.",
  "内部路由器 R": "Internal Router R",
  "分别计算外部前缀的路径类型、度量与下一跳。": "Calculate the path type, metric, and next hop for external prefixes separately.",
  "发布外部 LSA 的设备。": "Device advertising the external LSA.",
  "外部网关 / FA": "External Gateway / FA",
  "本示例共享网段上的外部转发目标。": "External forwarding target on the shared segment in this example.",
  "FA=0：解析 ASBR；FA≠0：解析 FA，并先检查它是否通过 OSPF 内部路径可达。": "FA=0: Resolve ASBR; FA≠0: Resolve FA, and first check if it is reachable via an OSPF internal path.",
  "非零 FA 不保证绕过 ASBR；是否绕行取决于拓扑。实际路由还受 E1/E2 度量与其他候选路由影响。": "A non-zero FA does not guarantee bypassing the ASBR; whether it bypasses depends on the topology. Actual routing is also affected by E1/E2 metrics and other candidate routes.",
