  "检查 P 与 FA": "Check P and FA",
  "P=1 且 FA 非零，继续由合格的翻译者判断。": "If P=1 and FA is non-zero, continue to be determined by a qualified translator.",
  "满足基本门槛；还需检查翻译者角色、路由选择与范围策略。": "Basic thresholds are met; translator role, route selection, and scope policies must also be checked.",
  "生成新的外部通告": "Generate new external advertisement",
  "翻译 ABR 按规则生成 Type-5，通告到支持外部 LSA 的区域。": "The translating ABR generates Type-5 according to rules and advertises it to areas that support external LSAs.",
  "Type-7 与 Type-5 是不同 LSA；NSSA 内仍使用 Type-7。": "Type-7 and Type-5 are different LSAs; Type-7 is still used within the NSSA.",
  "引入外部前缀并产生 Type-7。": "Introduce external prefixes and generate Type-7.",
  "翻译检查": "Translation check",
  "P=1、FA 非零只是必要条件；选举、范围聚合和最佳路径也参与决定。": "P=1 and FA non-zero are only necessary conditions; election, scope aggregation, and best path also participate in the decision.",
  "翻译 ABR": "Translating ABR",
  "依据 RFC 3101 生成相应 Type-5。": "Generate the corresponding Type-5 according to RFC 3101.",
  "NSSA 把区域内外部信息与域外传播分开；ABR 生成的 Type-7 缺省不应再翻译回骨干。": "NSSA separates intra-area external information from inter-domain propagation; Type-7 generated by ABR should not be translated back to the backbone by default.",
  "翻译者并非无条件由 Router-ID 最大的 ABR 担任，还受候选/强制角色、可达性及稳定机制影响。": "The translator is not unconditionally assumed by the ABR with the largest Router-ID; it is also affected by candidate/mandatory roles, reachability, and stability mechanisms.",
