  "SPF 图的伪节点代表网络，不是一台新增设备。邻接连线用于协议同步，不规定业务经过 DR。": "The pseudo-node in the SPF graph represents the network, not an additional device. Adjacency links are used for protocol synchronization and do not dictate that traffic must pass through the DR.",
