  "表示共享网络，Network-LSA 列出与 DR 完整邻接的路由器以及 DR 本身。": "Represents a shared network; the Network-LSA lists routers with full adjacencies to the DR, as well as the DR itself.",
  "DR 组织邻接与泛洪，伪节点简化拓扑表达；DR 并非所有业务流量的必经点。": "The DR organizes adjacencies and flooding; the pseudo-node simplifies topology representation; the DR is not a mandatory transit point for all traffic.",
  "2N−3 是一个网段中一台 DR、一台 BDR、其余 DROther 均稳定 Full 时的无向邻接数量。伪节点的双向 SPF 边度量不同，此图只展示连接关系。": "2N-3 is the number of undirected adjacencies in a network segment when one DR, one BDR, and the remaining DROthers are all in a stable Full state. The bidirectional SPF edge metrics for the pseudo-node differ; this diagram only shows connection relationships.",
