  "本例不包含 next policy、策略表达式、子策略或厂商扩展的继续匹配指令。不要把“接受”直接等同于已经发布到邻居。": "This example does not include next policy, policy expressions, sub-policies, or vendor-extended continue-match instructions. Do not equate \"accept\" directly with having already advertised to a neighbor.",
