  "名称对应 VRP 常见机制，命令支持依版本而异。接口 LSA 过滤可能破坏同区域 LSDB 一致性；本图结果仅限单路径和匹配前缀。": "Names correspond to common VRP mechanisms; command support varies by version. Interface LSA filtering may disrupt LSDB consistency within the same area; the results in this diagram are limited to single paths and matching prefixes.",
