  "沿有方向的路径看路由进入哪张表；RD 区分路由，RT 控制分发，下一跳决定可用性。": "Follow the directional path to see which table the route enters; RD distinguishes routes, RT controls distribution, and next-hop determines availability.",
  "Junos · VPN 路由分发": "Junos · VPN Route Distribution",
  "源 PE 按 VRF 配置与导出策略构造 VPN 路由并附加 RT；RD 是 VPN 前缀的一部分。": "The source PE constructs VPN routes based on VRF configuration and export policies, attaching RTs; RD is part of the VPN prefix.",
  "RD 用于区分相同 IPv4 前缀，不决定接收方。": "RD is used to distinguish identical IPv4 prefixes and does not determine the receiver.",
  "对端 PE 接收 VPN 路由，按策略、路由选择与下一跳解析进行处理。": "The remote PE receives the VPN route and processes it according to policies, route selection, and next-hop resolution.",
  "bgp.l3vpn.0 用于 VPN 路由；inet.3 常用于解析传输 LSP 下一跳。": "bgp.l3vpn.0 is used for VPN routes; inet.3 is commonly used for resolving transport LSP next-hops.",
  "本例目标 VRF 的导入策略接受该 RT；还需满足下一跳可达等条件。": "In this example, the import policy of the target VRF accepts this RT; other conditions such as next-hop reachability must also be met.",
  "路由可参与目标 VRF 的选择；FIB 安装是后续步骤。": "The route can participate in the selection of the target VRF; FIB installation is a subsequent step.",
  "源 PE · VRF-A": "Source PE · VRF-A",
