  "RD 解决唯一性，RT 表达分发意图，下一跳解析保证路由可用。": "RD resolves uniqueness, RT expresses distribution intent, and next-hop resolution ensures route availability.",
  "图示跨 PE 的 MP-BGP 分发。本地 VRF 间自动泄露还有 auto-export 等条件，不能把所有情形套成固定的三张表流水线。": "The diagram illustrates cross-PE MP-BGP distribution. Local VRF-to-VRF leaking also involves conditions like auto-export; do not force all scenarios into a fixed three-table pipeline.",
  "跨 PE VPN 路由分发与下一跳解析": "Cross-PE VPN route distribution and next-hop resolution",
