  "rib-group 在学习入口执行多表导入，各表仍独立选择可用路由。": "rib-group performs multi-table import at the learning ingress; each table still independently selects usable routes.",
  "不是持续复制整个数据库；不同协议、地址族和平台存在支持差异。先限制前缀范围，再核验回程。": "Not a continuous replication of the entire database; support varies by protocol, address family, and platform. Limit prefix range first, then verify the return path.",
  "协议学习点：路由产生 / 接收": "Protocol learning point: Route generation / reception",
  "多张 RIB：受策略约束的导入": "Multiple RIBs: Policy-constrained import",
  "分别检查两个方向": "Check both directions separately",
  "vrf-target 可以生成常见导入/导出行为；显式策略允许更细的规则。": "vrf-target can generate common import/export behaviors; explicit policies allow for finer-grained rules.",
  "先查 export，再查 import，避免混在一起判断。": "Check export first, then import, to avoid mixing the judgment process.",
  "查看实际生效策略": "View the actually effective policy",
  "配置显式 vrf-import / vrf-export 时，需要确认对应方向的 RT 匹配、附加和最终 accept。": "When configuring explicit vrf-import / vrf-export, you must confirm the corresponding direction's RT matching, attachment, and final acceptance.",
  "不要假设所有简写配置与显式策略自动叠加。": "Do not assume all shorthand configurations automatically stack with explicit policies.",
  "验证接收侧": "Verify the receiving side",
  "检查实际 VPN 路由携带的 RT 与导入策略，进一步检查下一跳和目标表。": "Check the RTs carried by the actual VPN route and the import policy, then further check the next hop and target table.",
  "RT 匹配仅满足分发条件之一。": "RT matching only satisfies one of the distribution conditions.",
  "导出方向": "Export direction",
  "给路由附加 RT": "Attach RT to route",
  "导入方向": "Import direction",
  "按“实际携带的 RT → 生效导入策略 → 目标表结果”排查，而不是只看配置行存在与否。": "Troubleshoot by 'actually carried RT → effective import policy → target table result', rather than just looking at whether the configuration line exists.",
  "vrf-import 并非只能匹配 community；官方示例也可组合 protocol 等条件。提交约束、auto-export 和平台行为应结合版本及实测。": "vrf-import is not limited to matching communities; official examples can also combine conditions like protocol. Commit constraints, auto-export, and platform behavior should be combined with version and actual testing.",
