  "OSPFv2 核心 LSA 架构哲学、报文字段与工程计算机制全量手册 · 二维位图": "OSPFv2 Core LSA Architecture Philosophy, Packet Fields, and Engineering Calculation Mechanism Full Manual · 2D Bitmap",
  "保留字段顺序与位宽；横向读位，纵向读偏移。": "Preserve field order and bit width; read bits horizontally, read offsets vertically.",
  "从原文 ASCII 边界推断位宽，空白续行按原图合并。": "Infer bit width from the original ASCII boundaries; merge blank continuation lines according to the original diagram.",
  "顶部是行内位编号，左侧是起始 bit 偏移；跨行字段保持同一名称。": "The top shows inline bit numbering, the left shows starting bit offset; cross-line fields maintain the same name.",
  "自动解析仅反映原图排版，无法判断可变长字段的实际长度；请同时核对原文。": "Automatic parsing only reflects the original layout and cannot determine the actual length of variable-length fields; please verify against the original text simultaneously.",
  "生成LSA的Router-ID": "Router-ID of the LSA generator",
  "保留位，置 0。": "Reserved bit, set to 0.",
  "TOS 标识这条附加度量适用的历史服务类型。它不是 OSPF 报文 Type 或 LSA type；普通现代部署通常只使用基本度量，附加 TOS 项常为 0 或不存在。": "TOS identifies the historical service type to which this additional metric applies. It is not an OSPF packet Type or LSA type; standard modern deployments usually only use basic metrics, and additional TOS items are often 0 or non-existent.",
  "与同一条目 TOS 对应的附加开销。它是旧式按服务类型选路的度量项，不能当作整个报文的长度或链路数量。": "Additional cost corresponding to the TOS of the same entry. It is a metric item for legacy Type-of-Service routing and cannot be treated as the length of the entire packet or the number of links.",
  "Opaque Type 是 Link State ID 的高 8 bit，用来标识扩展应用，例如 TE 使用自己的 Opaque 类型。它与决定泛洪范围的 LSA Type=9/10/11 是不同字段。": "The Opaque Type is the high 8 bits of the Link State ID, used to identify extended applications; for example, TE uses its own Opaque type. It is a different field from the LSA Type=9/10/11 that determines the flooding scope.",
  "Opaque ID 是 Link State ID 的低 24 bit，由对应扩展应用区分实例。它与 Opaque Type、Advertising Router 等一起定位通告，不能当作目的 IP 地址。": "The Opaque ID is the low 24 bits of the Link State ID, used by the corresponding extended application to distinguish instances. Together with the Opaque Type and Advertising Router, it locates the advertisement and cannot be used as a destination IP address.",
  "始发路由器 RID": "Originating Router RID",
  "TE Router Address TLV 携带路由器的稳定 IPv4 标识地址，常取环回地址，供流量工程识别节点。这里的 TLV 长度 4 表示值部分 4 字节，不包含 Type/Length 自身。": "The TE Router Address TLV carries the router's stable IPv4 identifier address, usually a loopback address, for traffic engineering to identify the node. The TLV length of 4 here indicates that the value portion is 4 bytes, excluding the Type/Length fields themselves.",
  "OSPFv2 报文类型与报文结构全解 · 二维位图": "Comprehensive Guide to OSPFv2 Packet Types and Structure · 2D Bitmap",
  "OSPF 认证体系底层全景实战手册 · 二维位图": "Practical Manual for the OSPF Authentication System Underlying Architecture · 2D Bitmap",
  "本图中 (8 Bytes) 占 32 bit，位于 OSPF 认证体系底层全景实战手册。它是原图自定义的对象；下方保留了对应原文，未将它套用为其他协议的同名字段。": "In this diagram, (8 Bytes) occupies 32 bits and is located in the Practical Manual for the OSPF Authentication System Underlying Architecture. It is a custom object from the original diagram; the original text is retained below, and it has not been applied as a field of the same name in other protocols.",
  "OSPF 协议有效载荷": "OSPF Protocol Payload",
  "本图中 OSPF 协议有效载荷 占 29 bit，位于 OSPF 认证体系底层全景实战手册。它是原图自定义的对象；下方保留了对应原文，未将它套用为其他协议的同名字段。": "In this diagram, OSPF Protocol Payload occupies 29 bits and is located in the Practical Manual for the OSPF Authentication System Underlying Architecture. It is a custom object from the original diagram; the original text is retained below, and it has not been applied as a field of the same name in other protocols.",
  "本图中 ...... 占 32 bit，位于 OSPF 认证体系底层全景实战手册。它是原图自定义的对象；下方保留了对应原文，未将它套用为其他协议的同名字段。": "In this diagram, ...... occupies 32 bits and is located in the Practical Manual for the OSPF Authentication System Underlying Architecture. It is a custom object from the original diagram; the original text is retained below, and it has not been applied as a field of the same name in other protocols.",
  "Message Digest (哈希摘要: 16或32字节，追加在尾部)": "Message Digest (Hash digest: 16 or 32 bytes, appended to the end)",
  "本图中 Message Digest (哈希摘要: 16或32字节，追加在尾部) 占 26 bit，位于 OSPF 认证体系底层全景实战手册。它是原图自定义的对象；下方保留了对应原文，未将它套用为其他协议的同名字段。": "In this diagram, Message Digest (Hash digest: 16 or 32 bytes, appended to the end) occupies 26 bits and is located in the Practical Manual for the OSPF Authentication System Underlying Architecture. It is a custom object from the original diagram; the original text is retained below, and it has not been applied as a field of the same name in other protocols.",
