  "这里表示前面的条目可以继续出现，不是一个额外的数据字段。应按条目格式、计数和长度读取后续内容，原图显示的行数不代表固定长度。": "This indicates that the preceding entries can continue to appear; it is not an additional data field. Subsequent content should be read according to the entry format, count, and length. The number of rows shown in the original diagram does not represent a fixed length.",
  "DR的接口IP地址": "DR interface IP address",
  "DR的Router-ID": "DR Router-ID",
  "Network-LSA 中每个 Attached Router 是与该网段 DR 建立完整邻接的路由器 Router-ID，并包含 DR 自身。它不是所有接在交换机上的主机 IP。多个 32 bit 条目列出伪节点连接的路由器。": "In a Network-LSA, each Attached Router is the Router-ID of a router that has established a full adjacency with the DR of that network segment, and it includes the DR itself. It is not the IP of all hosts connected to the switch. Multiple 32-bit entries list the routers connected to the pseudonode.",
  "所有邻居Router-ID": "All neighbor Router-IDs",
