  "按导入、导出两个方向分别查看实际生效策略。策略列表顺序、community 动作与终止动作都影响结果。": "View the actual effective policies separately for import and export directions. The order of the policy list, community actions, and termination actions all affect the result.",
  "不要把普通 BGP 的默认行为直接套到 vrf-export 或 auto-export；应检查具体挂载点。": "Do not directly apply the default behavior of standard BGP to vrf-export or auto-export; check the specific attachment points.",
  "把本地 VRF 互通、跨 PE VPN 路由分发和向 CE 发布分开验证。auto-export 主要涉及同一 PE 的本地路由泄露。": "Verify local VRF intercommunication, cross-PE VPN route distribution, and advertisement to CE separately. auto-export mainly involves local route leaking on the same PE.",
  "笔记中的 iBGP/eBGP 差异属于具体实验条件，不宜概括为“特权通道”或单凭原始协议推断结果。": "The iBGP/eBGP differences in the notes belong to specific experimental conditions and should not be generalized as a \"privileged channel\" or inferred solely from the original protocol.",
  "vrf-import 的匹配并非“必须且只能是 RT”。Junos 官方示例允许在 community 条件之外组合 protocol 等条件。": "vrf-import matching is not \"necessarily and exclusively RT\". Official Junos examples allow combining conditions such as protocol in addition to community conditions.",
  "实测结论应带上设备型号、版本、地址族、策略挂载方向以及 auto-export / vpn-apply-export 配置。": "Empirical conclusions should include device model, version, address family, policy attachment direction, and auto-export / vpn-apply-export configuration.",
  "先确认本地是否存在可用的缺省路由，再核对生成、匹配、发布三个环节。": "First confirm whether a default route exists locally, then verify the generation, matching, and advertisement stages.",
  "匹配 0.0.0.0/0 exact 与匹配所有 static 路由语义不同；aggregate 是否产生也受贡献路由等条件影响。": "Matching 0.0.0.0/0 exact is semantically different from matching all static routes; whether an aggregate is generated also depends on conditions such as contributing routes.",
  "比较相同协议、相同方向、相同地址族的策略行为，避免仅凭“拉取/推送”比喻翻译配置。": "Compare policy behaviors for the same protocol, same direction, and same address family; avoid translating configurations based solely on \"pull/push\" metaphors.",
  "迁移时应明确设计未命中动作；只有业务意图确实是放行时，才添加 permit 兜底。": "When migrating, clearly define the action for a miss; only add a permit catch-all if the business intent is truly to allow.",
  "RIB 是控制面候选与选路信息，FIB 是转发信息；不能把所有以 .0 结尾的表都直接称为转发表。": "RIB is control plane candidate and routing information, FIB is forwarding information; not all tables ending in .0 can be directly called forwarding tables.",
  "× 不满足条件": "× Condition not met",
  "← 上一步": "← Previous step",
  "下一步 →": "Next step →",
  "简单口令认证不隐藏口令；密码学认证携带认证参数与摘要，但不加密 OSPF 内容。": "Simple password authentication does not hide the password; cryptographic authentication carries authentication parameters and digests but does not encrypt OSPF content.",
  "换密需要同时验证两端支持的算法、Key ID 与收发有效期，不能仅凭时间窗重叠保证无中断。": "Key rotation requires simultaneous verification of supported algorithms, Key IDs, and validity periods on both ends; it cannot be guaranteed to be hitless based solely on overlapping time windows.",
  "IR、骨干路由器、ABR、ASBR 是功能角色，其中部分角色可以同时出现。": "IR, backbone router, ABR, and ASBR are functional roles, and some roles can coexist.",
  "ABR 的识别与工作条件存在实现差异；连接骨干、邻接状态和路由通告资格应分别检查。": "There are implementation differences in the identification and operating conditions of ABRs; backbone connectivity, adjacency status, and route advertisement eligibility should be checked separately.",
  "排障时分别查看 LSA 是否存在、路由是否安装；filter-policy import 不等于阻止所有泛洪。": "When troubleshooting, check separately whether the LSA exists and whether the route is installed; filter-policy import is not equivalent to blocking all flooding.",
  "接口出向 LSA 过滤的结果依赖是否存在其他传播路径，不能把单一路径示例直接套到冗余网络。": "The result of interface outbound LSA filtering depends on whether other propagation paths exist; do not directly apply single-path examples to redundant networks.",
  "区分 RFC 常量、厂商默认值和人为规划值；为设备版本建立可验证的参数基线。": "Distinguish between RFC constants, vendor defaults, and manually planned values; establish a verifiable parameter baseline for device versions.",
  "调整参考带宽需全域一致规划，并不意味着所有现网都应无条件修改默认值。": "Adjusting the reference bandwidth requires domain-wide consistent planning and does not mean that all live networks should unconditionally modify the default values.",
  "Router-ID 是协议标识，不要求等于当前转发接口地址；唯一性比数值大小更重要。": "Router-ID is a protocol identifier and is not required to be equal to the current forwarding interface address; uniqueness is more important than numerical value.",
  "把下一次选举的候选值与当前运行值分开看；实际生效条件按设备版本确认。": "View candidate values for the next election separately from the currently running values; confirm actual effective conditions according to the device version.",
  "· 3D 字段图": "· 3D Field Diagram",
