  "每个字段自动分开，点击砖块查看详情；可暂停或拖动时间轴停在这一刻。": "Each field is automatically separated; click on a block to view details; you can pause or drag the timeline to stop at this moment.",
  "数通知识星图": "Networking Knowledge Star Map",
  "领域是恒星、分类是行星、文章是卫星；连线表示知识关联。点击任意节点查看并跳转。": "Domains are stars, categories are planets, articles are satellites; lines represent knowledge associations. Click any node to view and navigate.",
